      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "<span style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.65\">**Down / Stale / N/A:** [Run Overview](/d/telemetry-overview?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam})에서 source와 freshness를 확인합니다.<br>**Step·stage가 느림:** [Agent RL Stage Correlation](/d/agent-rl-stage-correlation?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam}) → [Run Overview](/d/telemetry-overview?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam})에서 Duration을 누릅니다.<br>**Candidate 조사:** [Bottleneck Summary](/d/xlayer-bottleneck-summary?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam})의 supporting / counter / missing evidence → [Cross-Layer Timeline](/d/xlayer-cross-layer-timeline?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam}).<br>**Deep dive:** [Compute & Communication](/d/xlayer-compute-communication?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam}) · [Data & Storage](/d/xlayer-data-storage?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&${run_id:queryparam}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam}) · [Run Logs](/d/xlayer-run-logs?${cluster:queryparam}&${node:queryparam}&var-telemetry_run_id=${run_id:percentencode}&var-run_id=${log_run_id:percentencode}&${source_node:queryparam}&${record_id:queryparam}&${trace_id:queryparam}&${diagnosis_method:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}&${log_run_id:queryparam}&${gpu:queryparam}&${engine:queryparam}&${sandbox_node:queryparam}). Loki 화면은 log 수집을 연결했을 때 사용할 수 있습니다.</span>"
